msgstr "Jiri threads x"

#: setup.php
msgid "How many background threads do you wish Cacti to use when exporting graphs.  Default is 0 to run all export in poller thread, 1 or more to spawn separate background threads"
msgstr "Ọnụ ọgụgụ eri ndabere ole ka ị chọrọ ka Cacti jiri mgbe ọ na-ebupụ eserese.  Nke ndabere bụ 0 iji mee mbupụ niile n'ime eri poller, 1 ma ọ bụ karịa iji mepụta eri ndabere dị iche iche"

